To fix the issue, you can add null checks before attempting to create a new array instance and handle the case where `rawComponentType` is null. Here is a possible fix:

```java
if (type instanceof GenericArrayType) {
    final Class<?> rawComponentType = getRawType(((GenericArrayType) type).getGenericComponentType(), assigningType);
    if (rawComponentType == null) {
